---
import Card from "@/components/Card.astro";
import CardGrid from "@/components/CardGrid.astro";
import LandingSection from "@/components/LandingSection.astro";
---

<LandingSection title="What the modern website?" titleClassName="text-start from-violet-500 to-white/0">
  <CardGrid>
    <Card icon="line-md:speed-loop" title="Performance">
      Astro reduces JavaScript code from the website as much as possible. Browsers only need to execute minimal JS code,
      so maximizing performance.
    </Card>
    <Card icon="line-md:iconify1" title="Without complexity">
      Iconify generates icon components using only the icon source and the icon name. So, <span class="font-bold"
        >templates won't bloated by raw SVG tag.</span
      >
    </Card>
    <Card icon="line-md:cloud-alt-print-loop" title="Minimal styling">
      UnoCSS and daisyUI can create most UI and, UnoCSS generates only minimal classes and minimal styling.
    </Card>
    <Card icon="line-md:sun-rising-loop" title="Freedom">
      <span class="font-bold">UnoCSS is more flexible than TailwindCSS</span>, allowing to create utilities that you can
      specify any size. And, of course can use as Twind.
    </Card>
    <Card icon="line-md:star-pulsating-loop" title="Modern design">
      daisyUI makes it easy to build <span class="font-bold">a modern design website</span>. Supports responsive web
      design, dark mode, and has high accessibility.
    </Card>
    <Card icon="line-md:edit" title="Customizable">
      daisyUI only use tailwindCSS (Wind4 preset), customizable as much as you want! Can use the existing color scheme
      or create a new theme.
    </Card>
  </CardGrid>
</LandingSection>
